<title>UK: Dated Brent trades at firmer June Brent -20 cts.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades at firmer June Brent -20 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of North Sea benchmark Dated Brent traded at a firmer level of June Brent less 20 cents a barrel late on Friday afternoon, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load May 18-20, was one of four cargoes kept voluntarily ahead of the five o'clock deadline. It was sold by a European major to a trader, they said.</p>
<p>The others were kept by Shell UK (May 17-19), Esso (May 18-20) and Elf (May 19-21).</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
